: B-272 scripted trace of a leo 0.42 dispatch viewer moving between the
: background (`leo-dispatch`, attachable) and the caller's session (not
: attachable, pane still reported). The wire carries the move as
: `attachable` flipping on a `dispatch_changed` for the same id; the pane id
: never changes. Each "step N" comment opens one gate in
: LeoDispatchPlacementLiveIntegrationTests.

